Krita Nova 71 - Transform tool: proportional scaling by default

In the Transform tool's free transform, dragging a corner or side handle
now keeps the width : height ratio; holding Shift while dragging scales
width and height freely (the reverse of Krita, where Shift kept the ratio).
The "keep aspect ratio" chain in the tool options still keeps it always.

